FLAG                 VARIABLE               SETTING                  VALUE      SOURCE
--keep-going         JET_KEEP_GOING         check.keep_going         off        default
--keep-going-report  JET_KEEP_GOING_REPORT  check.keep_going_report  -          default
--keep-going-skip    JET_KEEP_GOING_SKIP    check.keep_going_skip    lint,docs  setting
--trace              JET_TRACE_FILE         check.trace              -          default
--trace-detail       JET_TRACE_DETAIL       check.trace_detail       functions  flag (hides JET_TRACE_DETAIL=phases)
--phase-counters     JET_PHASE_COUNTERS     check.phase_counters     on         environment
